  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Vulnerable Children to become Youth Leaders in South Africa: Shaping the Future of the Isibindi Safe Park Model Nationally</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project using particpatory film making to develop a &apos;youth-leadership&apos; programme + inform the national standards of the Isibindi Safe Parks programme. Benefits young people, communities, youth workers and policy makers in South Africa. SDGs 4,16,17</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
